      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"Boo! Fuck this dude! You're a clown",
          "rhyme":"un",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"Good afternoon, Class of 2010, my name is Jerome Weinberg (Ha ha!)",
          "rhyme":"ERg",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"I'm running for class president this year because I believe I can bring positive things to the student body (Wow)",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"My opponent, as you might've already heard, is Mac Miller (Chyeah!)",
          "rhyme":"e",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"Now, I know, he's the rapper, he gets all the ladies (Damn right)",
          "rhyme":"iz",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"5",
          "text":"And he's that popular guy",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"6",
          "text":"But do you really want somebody running your school that smokes that much marijuana? Is that safe for your environment here at school?",
          "rhyme":"ul",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"7",
          "text":"I've been in the bathroom and seen him lighting those... \"Dutch Masters\" in the stall, and that is not cool",
          "rhyme":"ul",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"8",
          "text":"So, vote for me, and not for weed",
          "rhyme":"id",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"9",
          "text":"Thank you, again, Jerome Weinberg",
          "rhyme":"ERg",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme":"ABCDECFFGB",
